Error [E0205]: A read `SharedGuard` cannot enter a write helper
  --> shared_read_guard_cannot_enter_write_helper.jet:9:11
    |
  9 |     bump(&guard)
    |           ^^^^^
 Why: The helper can edit through this parameter, so its caller must hold an exclusive Shared guard
 Fix: Create the guard with `guard_edit()` before passing it with the write-access marker `&`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0205
